                                "sense_id": "873f38dd-b52e-39bb-9cf6-619b0e5b4c4c",
                                "text": "“I’m not Mr. Laurence, I’m only Laurie.”\n“Laurie Laurence; what an odd name.”\n“My first name is Theodore, but I don’t like it, for the fellows called me Dora, so I made them say Laurie instead.”"
                            }
                        ]
