                        "entry_id": "1dc92380-927a-3629-b7b9-a4c0f8330d56",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A unisex given name.",
                            "A diminutive of the female given name Laura; popular as a female given name in the US in the mid-twentieth century."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
