                                "sense_id": "f005e482-56df-3374-b1e1-79d1a70198ae",
                                "text": "Laura called her parents. Her father answered. Fighting to keep her voice steady, Laura said, \"Hi, Daddy.\"\n\"Laurie? How's my little girl?\""
